# Lockfile — generated by pnpm, formatted by pnpm. Prettier must not own it.
# pnpm writes single-quoted YAML; Prettier rewrites it double-quoted, so the two fought on
# every dependency change: `pnpm install` would reformat the whole file (~19k line diff of
# pure whitespace) and CI's format check would fail long after the commit that caused it.
# Nothing but pnpm reads this file, so formatting it buys nothing. Note this does NOT relax
# lockfile correctness — CI keeps `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`, which is what guarantees
# the committed lockfile matches every package.json.
pnpm-lock.yaml

